  "body": "4.2. Names and labels\r\nhttps://encoding.spec.whatwg.org/#names-and-labels\r\n\r\n> This is a more basic and restrictive algorithm of mapping labels to encodings than section 1.4 of Unicode Technical Standard #22 prescribes\r\n\r\nThe link \r\nhttps://www.unicode.org/reports/tr22/#Charset_Alias_Matching\r\npoints to a stub page. To get to that section directly you need\r\nhttp://www.unicode.org/reports/tr22/tr22-8.html#Charset_Alias_Matching\r\n",
